usage: rebis.gene [-h] [--file FILE] [--stdin] COMMAND ...

rebis.gene — Gene Imscriber & Genetic Engineering

positional arguments:
  COMMAND               Sub-command (run with COMMAND --help for details)
    analyze             Analyze genetic sequence (codons, ORFs, base
                        composition, B4)
    quality             Compute genetic quality score
    tuples              Compute IG genetic tuples from sequence
    translate           Translate DNA to protein
    b4                  Run B4 lattice 64-codon Frobenius verification
    pipeline            Run full gene-to-protein pipeline
    list                List all exported symbols
    info                Show available tools (alias for list)
    help                Show this help message

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --file FILE, -f FILE  Input file (JSON or FASTA/sequence)
  --stdin, -i           Read JSON arguments from stdin
